 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "I been carrying my troubles like a sack of stones",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Carrying them down the highway, carrying them home",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Carried them to bed at night and woke up with them too",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lord, I'm tired of carrying, don't know what to do",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Casting all your anxiety on him",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because he cares for you",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Casting all your anxiety on him",
